            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in Sonault 1.11.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Try Sonault free for 14 days.</strong> New accounts can explore the full app before purchasing, one trial per Mac.</li>
  <li>Added an Account button to the sidebar, with clear trial status and license activation feedback.</li>
  <li>Buying from inside the app now checks out with the email you're signed in with, and Sonault unlocks as soon as you return.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
